# The repository root .gitignore has a bare `data/` rule for the server's data
# volume. A bare directory pattern matches at EVERY level, so it also swallowed
# `app/src/main/java/uz/miya/companion/data/` — the whole Room/DataStore layer
# (Prefs, TokenStore, UploadEntity, UploadDao, RecordingRepository,
# RecordingRef). Those files were untracked, so a fresh clone did not contain
# the app's queue at all and could not compile. Re-include the directory here:
# a deeper .gitignore wins over a shallower one, and the directory has to be
# re-included before anything inside it can be.
!app/src/main/java/uz/miya/companion/data/
!app/src/main/java/uz/miya/companion/data/**
